= Genomics — Technical =

Genome-scale analyses operate on coordinate systems, assemblies, features, variants, samples and populations. Interpretation depends on reference choice, assembly quality, annotation version, sequencing technology, mapping uncertainty, batch effects, and statistical multiple-testing structure.

== Modeling / evidence cautions ==
* genomics ≠ genetics
* genomics ≠ genome sequencing only
* genome-scale data ≠ biological interpretation by itself

